<title>UK: Marvel sets $86.5 mln three-year warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Marvel sets $86.5 mln three-year warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond with eqity warrants was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MARVEL INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SUMITOMO BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $86.5 MLN     COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    18.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	EXERCISE PERIOD 25.JUL.97 UNTIL 11.JUL.00</p>
<p>		EXERCISEABLE INTO SHARES OF SUMITOMO HEAVY</p>
<p>		AT 435 YEN PER SHARE, FOREX FIX 115.6 YEN/$</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
